      <p class="text-sm text-ink-3 mt-1">Gérez vos cartes, consultez vos plafonds et vos dépenses.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto">
      <a href="{{path('app_customer_dashboard')}}" class="btn-ghost flex-1 sm:flex-none justify-center"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h4M12 17h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="10" cy="17" r="2.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>Paramètres des cartes</a>
      <a href="{{path('app_customer_dashboard')}}" class="btn-primary flex-1 sm:flex-none justify-center"><svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5.5v13M5.5 12h13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Commander une carte</a>
    </div>
  </div>

